Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:47:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add a usage log: app opens, resumes and logins

- New table and function in database/usage-log.sql; the server records
  the IP address and country, the app sends time and device details
- Entries are queued on the phone and sent when there is a connection
- Short notice in Settings that opens are recorded

